      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-p/q6-solution-2.svg\" alt=\"x7 + 1 y = (x7)3 + 2x7 + 1 = 0.095753 and hence y = 0.095753 . . ., so M = (−1.678, 0.096) . [A1] (c) The iterates alternate about the fixed point, giving a cobweb: The iteration function has derivative 1/x3 &lt; 0 near the fixed point. [A1]\" style=\"--madas-width:677.3px\"></figure>",
